.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char* " dest ", const char* " src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrcat
appends the string pointed to by
.I src
to the end of the string pointed to by
.IR dest ,
overwriting the null terminator at the end of
.I dest
and adding a new null terminator.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the new length of the concatenated string.
